{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB劇集《璀璨之城》已經踏入結局篇，劇中主角同場鬥飆戲，而昨晚（3日）最驚爆劇情非高海寧借醉獻身給吳卓羲莫屬，原來背後卻隱藏極大陰謀。</p><p>這一場驚天設局是高海寧向吳卓羲控訴母親王綺琴遭張智霖「軟禁」，借酒澆愁的她，乘機向吳卓羲投懷送抱。</p><p>不過高</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:45:28.299115+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:56:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:24.047200+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:24.047200+00:00","content_hash":"aa9ab485659a9448bdfcd7418f8a59f7d27a13ed7dc319e74a4a8b8ad2d99749","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}